type: AttributeCrafter
size: 2
name: Incineration Rig

maxBoost: 1.5
boostScale: 0.25
description: "
Incinerates items rapidly
Produces slag as a byproduct

Cant incinerate any items that are 
unflammable
[green]
- Incinerates items
- Scale with heat from tile
- produces slag[red]
- Explosive
- Cant incinerate unflammable items
- requires power
"

category: production
requirements: [lead/175, copper/150, graphite/75, silicon/40, metaglass/40]
